ora Linux 43 (Forty Three) on Wayland - X11 display driver, Single-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 9070 XT (RADV GFX1201) - AMD Ryzen 9 9950X3D 16-Core Processor (32 threads) - 60.39 GiB memory - PulseAudio (44100 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\n`PopupMenu` tooltips seem to be broken in several ways:\n\n1. They don't take scaling into account correctly\n2. They don't take margins into account correctly\n3. They don't take the search bar into account at all\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Run the MRP main scene\n2. Right-click somewhere right-of-center\n3. Try to scroll around and hover over the items to get a tooltip\n4. Note how there's no tooltip, or it's of the wrong item\n5. Remove the scaling and margins from the `PopupMenu`\n6. Note how it's now fine\n7. Enable the search bar\n8. Note how it's not fine anymore\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[popup-menu-tooltips.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/27013651/popup-menu-tooltips.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/r